// Made with the Ch6 scripts.
// - The hidden Revive becomes a sign running a script (the engine ignores BgKind::HiddenItem:
//   the SIL1 Task F fallback). Restore with:
//     HiddenItem(x: 22, y: 13, item: "ITEM_REVIVE", flag: "FLAG_SIL_ITEM_MANGA_SQUARE_REVIVE"),
// - Manga_Square_Sc01 (bypass): arriving by the Monks' shortcut (1, 25), the exit walk lands on
//   (1, 26) (04_reach.ron) and the player walks east to (2, 26), never on the coord (2, 25). The
//   two cells get the same coord (VAR_SIL_STORY 61), so every way out of the shortcut crosses
//   one (the scene sets 62, which the Dojo's queue needs).
[
    Coord(x: 1, y: 26, var: "VAR_SIL_STORY", value: 61, script: "MangaSquare_Sc01"),
    Coord(x: 2, y: 26, var: "VAR_SIL_STORY", value: 61, script: "MangaSquare_Sc01"),
    Delete(kind: Bg, index: 5),
    Sign(x: 22, y: 13, script: "MangaSquare_EventScript_HiddenRevive"),
]
